0..74 Comment "// The string operations of the `string` namespace: containment, equality,"
75..150 Comment "// prefix and suffix, escaping and splitting. The native `string` namespace"
151..229 Comment "// holds `append`, `eq` and `lt` (`simple-builtins.gandr`), so the others name"
230..307 Comment "// no member of it; scanning and escaping are planned text primitives (#318)."
308..379 Comment "// Equality is written `==`, which resolves the prelude\'s `Eq` model of"
380..441 Comment "// strings (#1832); their order is written `<`, through `Ord`"
442..465 Comment "// (`model-ord.gandr`)."
